==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[Pop Quiz Pain]], so any strategies used there will work here as well.

Strong midrangers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] along with some meatshields are really all you need to beat this level, as the Ottas and SBKs are both unbuffed.

